82185L28.6955 8.2871C29.5273 7.46344 30.4387 6.84899 31.4296 6.44377C32.4201 6.03855 33.4625 5.83594 34.5568 5.83594C35.6511 5.83594 36.6961 6.03855 37.6916 6.44377C38.6872 6.84899 39.5968 7.46344 40.4205 8.2871L49.9796 17.8462C50.8032 18.6699 51.433 19.6084 51.869 20.6619C52.3045 21.715 52.5223 22.7857 52.5223 23.8738C52.5223 24.9619 52.3045 26 51.869 26.9882C51.433 27.9764 50.8032 28.8823 49.9796 29.7059L31.0574 48.6164C30.5689 49.115 30.0204 49.487 29.4118 49.7324C28.8032 49.9774 28.165 50.0998 27.4973 50.0998Z\" fill=\"white\"></path> </svg> <h4>Inclusive</h4> <p>Share new ideas and work collaboratively across teams.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div></div><div id=\"av_section_6\"><div itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03.png\" alt=\"\" title=\"careers-03\" height=\"1056\" width=\"966\" itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03.png 966w, https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03-457x500.png 457w, https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03-942x1030.png 942w, https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03-768x840.png 768w, https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/careers-03-645x705.png 645w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 966px) 100vw, 966px\"></p></div><div><div><h3 itemprop=\"headline\">Team and technology</h3></div>\n<div itemprop=\"text\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\"><p>We’re a fun group of passionate entrepreneurs who built our own revolutionary software designed to make shipping simple. EasyPost started as an Engineering first company and we are proud to have a pragmatic approach to software development. Our team has a wealth of diverse experience and different backgrounds ranging from startups to large technology companies.Be part of a leading technology company:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CI/CD inspired workflows – we deploy dozens of times a day</li>\n<li>Small services over monoliths – we’ve deployed hundreds of services</li>\n<li>Strong engineering tooling and developer support</li>\n<li>Transparency and participation around architecture and technology decisions</li>\n<li>Culture of blamelessness and improving today from yesterday’s shortcomings</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div><div id=\"av_section_7\"><div><h3 itemprop=\"headline\">Benefits and perks</h3></div>\n<div itemprop=\"text\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\">\n\t<div> <p><img src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/icon-careers-01.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>Medical, dental, vision plans</h4>\n\t</div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/icon-careers-02.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>Flexible time-off</h4>\n\t</div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/icon-careers-03.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>Stock option opportunities</h4>\n\t</div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/icon-careers-04.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>Cross-functional learning</h4>\n\t</div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://www.easypost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/icon-careers-05.svg\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>Monthly virtual events</h4>\n\t</div>\n</div></div><div id=\"av_section_8\"><div><h3 itemprop=\"headline\">Start your adventure at EasyPost</h3></div>\n\n<div itemprop=\"text\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/CreativeWork\"> <div> <h3>Engineering</h3> </div> <div> <h3>Product Management</h3> </div> <div> <h3>Sales</h3> </div> <div> <h3>Systems &amp; Security</h3> </div> </div></div><!-- close default .container_wrap element --> <!-- end main --> </div></div>",
